- Stage 07: COMPLETE, EXECUTE_FAILURE_TEST;
- Stage 08: COMPLETE;
- Stage 09: COMPLETE;
- Stage 10: FREEZE;
- Stage 11: EXECUTE_RUN;
- Stage 12: VERIFY;
- Stage 13: COMPARE;
